{"id":"ganador","lemma":"ganador","pos":"adj","rank":1732,"glosses":["winning"],"ipa":"/ɡanaˈdoɾ/","forms":{"feminine":"ganadora","masculinePlural":"ganadores","femininePlural":"ganadoras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/71/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ganador.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tomás es claramente el ganador.","en":"Tom is clearly the winner.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519135"},{"text":"Supe que ella sería la ganadora.","en":"I knew she would be the winner."},{"text":"Los ganadores no consumen drogas.","en":"Winners don't use drugs."},{"text":"Tom es el ganador.","en":"Tom is the winner."},{"text":"Tenemos poca posibilidad de ser ganadores.","en":"We have little chance of winning."}]}